      "promotion_reason": "Controlled OLS (n=62,173) found Ridge's elite/high-volume under-prediction survives controlling for sample size, season, and TOG - not a small-sample artefact. A Ridge alpha grid (0.1-50) showed elite bias barely moves with regularisation strength, ruling out excessive L2 shrinkage as the cause. Huber (robust loss) improved overall MAE (3.931->3.907) and bias (+0.063->-0.030), reduced 28+ bias (-0.420->-0.307) and 25+ bias (-0.065->+0.013), IMPROVED (not worsened) low-history (<5 games) over-prediction (+1.703->+1.082), maintained calibration at 20/25/30/35+, and won on MAE in all 8 evaluated seasons (2019-2026). ElasticNet and a player-baseline+contextual-residual challenger were both evaluated and rejected (worse elite bias and/or worse low-history bias) \u2014 see scripts/elite_disposal_challenger_research.py for the full comparison."
    }
